To create a 2D plot depicting a point $x$ being dominated by three other points $y_1$, $y_2$, and $y_3$, we will utilize the power of LaTeX, TikZ, and pgfplots. Below is a step-by-step guide to achieve this:

### Step 1: Define Professional Looking Colors and Styles

We will define a set of professional-looking colors and styles to enhance the appearance of our plot.

