```

### Step 2: Create the Plot

We will now create the plot using pgfplots.

```latex
\begin{document}

\begin{tikzpicture}
\begin{axis[
    width=12cm,
    height=8cm,
    axis lines=middle,
    xlabel=$x$,
    ylabel=$y$,
    grid=major,
